        "toolchain.rustcDevLlvmDigest": "plan.nativeContextDigests and the registered context closureJoins.",
        "SyntaxGrammarBundleV1.closureId": "plan.nativeContextDigests and the registered context closureJoins."
      },
      "selectionLaw": "Direct members must be in plan.semanticClosures. Other-input dependencies need not be flattened into it; extra admissible retained closures may be selected explicitly. There is no exact-minimal-set constraint."
    }
